    {
      "id": "1fc15e9ef18a9c25478f884752c19dd1f7eed9a27d717fe9de4f190e384c7e7c",
      "text": "Next lesson",
      "hash": "d0ae2a13d8665949dd104a2fbdedcc8bca3e647a1e131d1ebaeb31c189a553b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "223499a6a5256cffef9f70ca7f5f3e869987ccd9dba38108964612e3c6e11e9a",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b98a7ef1b199413e4d7ec3d9f07663d5086625816dc5bd3a51cd37935fed5296",
      "text": "Retrieving Partial Objects",
      "hash": "8a60e1f7d38df0be4a6f390747b2308e1acb82270a52f23b039d8ba5b87bf4f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "84a4a30e6501a2c1f9201f7ce85a654269e8c9492d2c49357967168ed14673ec",
      "text": "Use Cases",
      "hash": "b697dd6a71d927892f7e03c35f8e6e7e7ab4b70e61b73aad74e0cd598a02aefe"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b6ba980a7d38beb3697a5d7bc4a9eca74429be97fdccd5eccb67aef68366a3",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "9abfbf480284c5b63630d9a1b7827fbf4903993858063d42ca1bf7ea4dfa4bc4",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5a840c8d4bf173267b2846268dcf02bd4ef22861d64d8d5f22fb474aa73ec9f",
      "text": "In the previous example, I showed you how to get structured outputs from an LLM, but the outputs were all generated at once.",
      "hash": "8fb6a72458f225ca31b184c3d784dec75349edf359a1a536ddf47fb608c843e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "00753294c4dc637d3a33a46921106eecb00d539762d139c3430653517cc1e1a5",
      "text": "We waited for a little bit and then we saw all the outputs at once.",
      "hash": "a27efd12962cb1f175a4a79227e4992d9cee2deed2897de7abfbf59e6537c1e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "2df00da6ccbd16c5361193925bc50528fa10a7e740a082cd16d4631eb8398e23",
      "text": "What if you want to see the output as they're generated? In other words, what if you want to stream an object?",
      "hash": "495beae764fee29dfe4c4ae36f6172ea139e8758c1201c6d3b4e961cfc6ab77f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5eb24b0e7e49e05b90c73ca2efb712f20e0e7bb1269e1bcbb68c11286c4bf73a",
      "text": "You can do that by changing",
      "hash": "a8bbfa8d0ee3dee575051d63cb659736ca22c6faf5fb467f3bd7e87b9718bbda"
    },
    {
      "id": "5444a4f2a662200a3fbb136fc8e70686604d287ab29215a7529e171cbfbe622f",
      "text": "You'll notice a couple of changes from the previous example.",
      "hash": "666e6270ef4c6cb6be3d485ea027e31a4bba33932b30a91970321a9be3005b5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7a9bc5f426e83151675734b0f1b0c5a1347193d6df33d2d070587f33a1ca75d",
      "text": "First of all, we have to wait for the final result of the object. We're doing that by awaiting",
      "hash": "48be9014164a15340c983eaa54e2043a28169f4c0851655722fea2a16b55a32d"
    },
    {
      "id": "76f468c1248674b7e7396f04c8e7d4f7ba6ce1ed8319e9cce7c8e8e73df7f226",
      "text": "The reason for this is that",
      "hash": "d9d465a79da96dc873e9b4b3c70d733c8cb07b6a85d5c54b9b7d5e9ef456c5b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "73630bf73cc257572f2413fdfb04a1d63b95e361d9fb23d0016e6c76e955c250",
      "text": "returns its result as soon as the first chunk comes in. Awaiting",
      "hash": "bc42ed6183d0bd3b7d5debbaa102a792acb1a8fa34db2ef519af3c74cca529f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "8121da00bc99d2d7524384406663d79fb732098d1f6192f8788df511b5bc467c",
      "text": "means we can wait for the final object.",
      "hash": "101b40c3cd22906720248cbd9b66d16159df2da190e225af3a4484662ec1f585"
    },
    {
      "id": "0cda19f05059081d8f6ba03d0a1c3ea00d0215fdc765b087ab6127434d203720",
      "text": "If we want access to the partial object as it's being generated, we can use",
      "hash": "82445fc90c176425e195f00684020dcbf62ab13dcf1eea446bfa1b055cf1bbba"
    },
    {
      "id": "d59af3e9b5bb3286de54331972dda75a089f18db61c05f3f86db3b255eae0a50",
      "text": "This is an async iterable. That means we can use a",
      "hash": "7213108478ea223f9ebd0c4c9d89bd2c32d8c222e6434700a30a80f646e98bff"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b346babab373fbdb9a41e3992f958db10f689d320dbb44933ee673ff7b48f40",
      "text": "loop to log every update to the object as it's posted to us.",
      "hash": "b8580a415e24470022158b79fc07784e182d8402e790e9d590eac1d097e373d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba7013ca0525c114e8256c5f9dc3db6582f0bfe8dfeb7b9e0a15cef4776bd630",
      "text": "We're going to clear the console first and then log the object so we should see it streaming in live.",
      "hash": "0ab488d573438de9d198e3c92856e4bfdb63fb3b54af10564e678566552e5952"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9cefa03e65129a8d1e456fa22a0ae79182a8d917ad8b92026a66ef98bc7df3c",
      "text": "Let's give this a go and see what outputs we get. Let's ask it how to make hummus.",
      "hash": "d1ba417240471820bc4ebf0a7610688a9ac86c404499eca46e46632eae4ade94"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb2c27f48098d5655671dbfadcd81eba870d5befe597bf33da282b0ba6110313",
      "text": "As you can see, the objects are coming in as they're generated and building the object up over time.",
      "hash": "228b0e6e374557b9e3e999772a77ec234934b61fe5755393db27b74ca5a9300b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c920c5130f25b7326e3a20d8994931907f7ed6a21f460ef02d35cbcf4247f403",
      "text": "Then the final chunk of this stream contains the entire object.",
      "hash": "0b0de3e04d4ca7907051dda7a933a2e01adf5b2c3d56ae78083368aed078d8cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6fdc635fece046d1b6002d06409549e18ea05213bd682b90465a58c4673f264",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "7500cb982e8dbecd7c06adb1376ce3de33e03ac2dd16ad8cf78ba02bfedb6ea6",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c9d578bdf2efebc390410467d2b035c20005064d0983c1a2bdc12863206a95a",
      "text": "The way you'd use this in an application is instead of just logging things to the console, you would send these chunks over the network.",
      "hash": "96ba8aa88972b3bb08a453483caa3b0d9cc937f24082349784d4b4e60c8b2de1"
    },
    {
      "id": "33b9e011590aa2d2c1baeda300f94fafba17b3fcf69909a714cd655523760441",
      "text": "That way, your users could see the object being built up in real time. It's always much nicer to see a progress indicator instead of it just waiting and then spitting it all out in one chunk.",
      "hash": "055f86041d43a1dbc867568557da8c57ff145b422872325ec885e3eddd0193b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "487e41550c56844eb00d52bbf0f8e37337998c85c014f6c99096f42dd56996ad",
      "text": "So that's what the",
      "hash": "17e4709216723f638da1954268167a9596923cf8e735eda7cfab8814f164aa19"
    },
    {
      "id": "7334c497259828a777e55dff5ce381af7a430f428fbc9bf258c3a932647b4645",
      "text": "function does in the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "ccc609c37cb94b964f6d6f524a5407fdc630f1c3a702320d6e844b42f9765e2c"
    },
    {
